## Verse 1
A[Am]las my [C]love you [G]do me [Em]wrong
To [Am]cast me [E7]off discour[Am]teously
And [Am]I have [C]loved you [G]oh so [Em]long
De[Am]lighting [E7]in your [Am]company

## Chorus
Green[C]sleeves was [G]all my [Em]joy
Green[C]sleeves was [E7]my de[Am]light
Green[C]sleeves was [G]my heart of [Em]gold
And [Am]who but my [E7]lady Green[Am]sleeves

